	<string>Yahweh's Words uses system audio services to play Bible and sermon audio. The app does not record from the microphone.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Save a verse image to your photos, so you can keep it or send it on. Nothing is uploaded.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Choose one of your own photos as the background of a verse image. The photo is used only on that card and is not stored or uploaded.</string>
